  "ingredients": [
    "1 sheet frozen puff pastry, thawed",
    "1 (8 ounce) wheel Brie cheese",
    "0.25 cup sliced almonds"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9-inch pie pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fbqdCF4Ub5e9WCBuD9ECYD0HQkk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15192-baked-brie-in-puff-pastry-VAT-step-01-1-7c29414c32e444da8a70b255d2199084.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15192/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice Brie cheese in half horizontally into two flat wheels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-KWE_o4qaiPvRuuYHRn1LIEoa1E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15192-baked-brie-in-puff-pastry-VAT-step-02-91070b01cb9043198ea8b0f10da57335.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15192/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place puff pastry into the prepared pie pan. Place one wheel of Brie onto the pastry dough with the rind facing down. Sprinkle almonds evenly over Brie.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eJnVVkX8c-b63vAx5FyVsD25udE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15192-baked-brie-in-puff-pastry-VAT-step-03-c40041552abe4d7f8072f03f25179607.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15192/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with the remaining wheel, with the rind facing up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Bg2sQZdqmvu4rBrp3t-uLKTbX4Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15192-baked-brie-in-puff-pastry-VAT-step-04-ef71803663764a179bdcc0dcffe3306f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15192/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bundle puff pastry around Brie and pinch the ends together to seal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sQNJbGYgBodFQhXwXRnnkYqshsI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15192-baked-brie-in-puff-pastry-VAT-step-05-6481d26bda54482d9355d4ff4b74fb9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15192/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 to 20 minutes. Let cool for 5 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8G6bJdnJ251VrxVSmqUptueOHeI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-15192-baked-brie-in-puff-pastry-VAT-step-06-55aacf9efbdd4b2dac2f80866b5e2fec.jpg"
